  "content": "<html><body>\n<h3><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1359411/description_65f5744e-c9e3-4eb4-b2a9-4460958f59bd.png\"></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbrewing-potions-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/636bbebeeb86361b6c3672ae2811673d645ec08c.png\" alt=\"Download on Modrinth\" width=\"200\">&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/devav/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b74cf8f9bc167120468ea968ba0e77c63fdfdaeb.png\" alt=\"Available on CurseForge\" width=\"220\">&nbsp;</a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fbrewing-potions-guide%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0028f46ca798440db511e04046ae854c657ecb73.png\" alt=\"Download on MCPEDL\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1455481?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=f16436&label=CurseForge\" alt=\"CurseForge Downloads\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/devav\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1455481/description_66cd220d-d402-43d1-9875-a1cc14179f4a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\"></a></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>紋理包 [成就友好]</strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1359411/description_29cfe572-2398-437e-89ad-53341492848f.png\"></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">藥水或釀造指南缺少了一些在製作桌上已有的東西，藥水指南，所有必要的藥水來增加他們的耐用性，使它們像投擲藥水一樣，如果你是一個新的Minecraft玩家，或者總是想知道如何製作這種藥水，那麼使用這個紋理包，你會發現它添加到用戶界面後就不需要了。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>在這裡你可以看到添加插件到你的Minecraft世界時的樣子。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1359411/description_193a0890-c58f-4350-94ae-e26892cd5849.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">而且更多但是我懶了 😅</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">絕對一切測試了。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此紋理包在Android和iOS手機上進行測試，還在Windows 10和11上進行測試。由於Minecraft床版的工作原理，它應該在所有平台上運行，與所有加載項和紋理包兼容，你不需要激活實驗性功能。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>免責聲明</strong></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如果你在錄製並顯示紋理，請務必留下原始的MCPEDL鏈接。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請勿放置直接鏈接或自定義鏈接。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>非常感謝。</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://mcpedl.com/villager-trade-preview/full-unlock/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1359411/description_47381974-03d7-46a6-868a-a30c21c5269a.gif\"></a></p> \n</body></html>",
